.SH LIMITATIONS
Screen adapters are provided for PC and ARM64 QEMU kernels.
It does not use shared memory, frame editing,
OSC 52 clipboard synchronization, or audio.
Raw RGB over a real 115200-baud link is slow.
Use a dedicated connection to a trusted terminal; this is not an
authenticated transport.
Attaching a different terminal requires a
.B redraw
request, and detaching the driver requires rebooting.
